# Validation artifacts a run writes into the checkout it is validating: the plan
# it is handed, the applicability document beside it, and the receipts it
# produces. This keeps them out of `git status` and out of an accidental commit.
# It is not what makes the runner tolerate them — the runner reads no ignore
# rule at all, and answers for an untracked file by asking whether the
# candidate's own classification says any group would read it.
/plan.json
/plan.err
/applicability.json
/request.txt
/reuse.out
/receipts/
/cabal.project.vulkan.local
/dist-vulkan/
# The retired proof harness's build directory, which existing checkouts may hold.
/dist-vulkan-proof/
# The shader toolchain fingerprint `hetoimasia-shader-fingerprint` generates
# before every shader build; it names this machine's native prefix.
/packages/gpu-vulkan/native/shaders/toolchain.fingerprint
